_em_specimen.concentration 1.9
_em_specimen.details
'Sample was prepared by pre-forming Tom1:H2B complex. In tandem, UBE2D2/UBA1/ubiquitin were incubated in reaction buffer containing Mg-ATP for twenty minutes at room temperature, then buffer exchanged. The enzymatic cascade was initiated by mixing both samples and quenched by plunge freezing. Final sample concentrations were: 5 uM Tom1, 10 uM histone H2B, 0.25 uM UBA1, 44 uM UBE2D2, 75 uM ubiquitin, 0.2 mM CHAPSO.'
